---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home Assistant Pet Monitoring Setup Finder UK 2026"
  description="Pick the right Home Assistant pet monitoring setup in 60 seconds. Route visitors to the full guide, camera review, and supporting pet-monitoring resources."
  canonicalPath="/pet-monitoring-setup-finder/"
>
  <section class="finder-hero">
    <div class="container finder-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Revenue tool · pet monitoring</p>
        <h1>Pick the right Home Assistant pet setup in 60 seconds.</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          This page turns pet-monitoring traffic into the right offer: the full Home Assistant guide, the pet-monitoring article cluster, and the camera review that best matches the visitor's use case.
          It filters by room size, privacy needs, and budget so visitors stop bouncing and start buying.
        </p>
        <div class="metrics">
          <div class="metric"><strong>Lead qualification</strong><span>Sorts readers into guide-only, camera-first, or full setup paths.</span></div>
          <div class="metric"><strong>Conversion routing</strong><span>Pushes the highest-fit Gumroad CTA before they leave.</span></div>
          <div class="metric"><strong>Affiliate assist</strong><span>Surfaces the camera review and buying guide for extra clicks.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel card">
        <h2>Setup finder</h2>
        <p>Choose the visitor's situation. The recommendation updates instantly.</p>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="use-case">What are they monitoring?</label>
          <select id="use-case">
            <option value="single-room">One room / one main space</option>
            <option value="hallway">Hallway / stairs / entryway</option>
            <option value="whole-home">Whole room coverage or open-plan space</option>
            <option value="multiple">Multiple rooms or long-term setup</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label>Privacy preference</label>
          <div class="segmented" role="group" aria-label="Privacy preference">
            <button type="button" data-privacy="cloud" aria-pressed="true">Cloud is fine</button>
            <button type="button" data-privacy="local" aria-pressed="false">Prefer local-only</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="budget">Budget ceiling</label>
          <input id="budget" type="range" min="50" max="400" step="10" value="150" />
          <div class="range-row"><span>£50</span><span id="budget-label">£150</span><span>£400+</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="results" id="results" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container grid-2">
    <article class="card content">
      <h3>What this page sells</h3>
      <ul class="list">
        <li>The full Home Assistant guide for people starting from zero.</li>
        <li>The pet-monitoring article cluster for readers who need more context.</li>
        <li>The camera review for readers ready to choose hardware now.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="pill-row">
        <span class="pill">Home Assistant</span>
        <span class="pill">Pet monitoring</span>
        <span class="pill">Reolink cameras</span>
        <span class="pill">AI alerts</span>
        <span class="pill">PoE reliability</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="card content">
      <h3>Why it works</h3>
      <p>
        Visitors who want "just a camera" often need guidance, not another generic sales page. This tool identifies intent, then sends them to the page most likely to close the sale: the guide for beginners, the review for hardware buyers, or the monitoring post for people still comparing options.
      </p>
      <p class="small">
        Primary CTA: <a id="primary-link-inline" href="https://gumroad.com/l/ai-home-assistant-guide?utm_source=filce_uk&utm_medium=quiz&utm_campaign=pet_monitoring_guide" data-plausible-event="pet_monitoring_finder_primary_cta_click" data-plausible-prop-surface="inline-callout" data-plausible-prop-route="guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored">Build Your Own AI Home Assistant</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="container support card">
    <h3>Supporting links</h3>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="cta primary" href="https://gumroad.com/l/ai-home-assistant-guide?utm_source=filce_uk&utm_medium=quiz&utm_campaign=pet_monitoring_guide" data-plausible-event="pet_monitoring_finder_primary_cta_click" data-plausible-prop-surface="supporting-links" data-plausible-prop-route="guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored">Buy the Home Assistant guide</a>
      <a class="cta secondary" href="/posts/home-assistant-pet-monitoring/" data-plausible-event="pet_monitoring_finder_supporting_link_click" data-plausible-prop-surface="supporting-links" data-plausible-prop-destination="article">Read the pet-monitoring article</a>
      <a class="cta secondary" href="/posts/best-pet-monitoring-cameras-uk-2025/" data-plausible-event="pet_monitoring_finder_supporting_link_click" data-plausible-prop-surface="supporting-links" data-plausible-prop-destination="comparison">Compare cameras first</a>
      <a class="cta secondary" href="/posts/reolink-fisheye-camera-review/" data-plausible-event="pet_monitoring_finder_supporting_link_click" data-plausible-prop-surface="supporting-links" data-plausible-prop-destination="review">See the Reolink review</a>
    </div>
    <p class="footer-note">
      Revenue mechanism: convert research traffic into a higher-fit purchase path, then continue earning from affiliate clicks when visitors need hardware before the guide.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const state = {
    privacy: 'cloud',
    useCase: 'single-room',
    budget: 150,
  };

  const budgetInput = document.getElementById('budget');
  const budgetLabel = document.getElementById('budget-label');
  const useCase = document.getElementById('use-case');
  const results = document.getElementById('results');
  const privacyButtons = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-privacy]'));
  const guideUrl = 'https://gumroad.com/l/ai-home-assistant-guide?utm_source=filce_uk&utm_medium=quiz&utm_campaign=pet_monitoring_guide';
  const articleUrl = '/posts/home-assistant-pet-monitoring/';
  const cameraUrl = '/posts/reolink-fisheye-camera-review/';
  const comparisonUrl = '/posts/best-pet-monitoring-cameras-uk-2025/';

  function formatBudget(value) {
    return `£${Number(value).toLocaleString('en-GB')}`;
  }

  function calcRecommendation() {
    const b = state.budget;
    const local = state.privacy === 'local';
    const multiple = state.useCase === 'multiple';
    const wholeHome = state.useCase === 'whole-home';
    const hallway = state.useCase === 'hallway';

    let title = 'Best fit: Home Assistant guide first';
    let blurb = 'Start with the guide, then add one reliable camera and simple automations. This is the safest route for visitors who are still learning the ecosystem.';
    let primary = guideUrl;
    let secondary = articleUrl;
    let bullets = [
      'Open the guide first so they do not waste money on the wrong hardware.',
      'Use the pet-monitoring article as social proof and setup context.',
      'Keep the next step cheap until they know whether they need PoE, AI, or multiple cameras.'
    ];
    let primaryRoute = 'guide';
    let secondaryRoute = 'article';

    if (local || wholeHome || multiple || b >= 250) {
      title = 'Best fit: full guide + Reolink fisheye camera';
      blurb = 'This visitor cares about reliability, room coverage, or local-first monitoring. Push the guide plus the camera review so they can choose the right hardware with confidence.';
      primary = cameraUrl;
      primaryRoute = 'camera-review';
      secondary = guideUrl;
      secondaryRoute = 'guide';
      bullets = [
        'Lead with the camera review because hardware is the likely blocker.',
        'Add the guide as the paid upsell for the automation layer.',
        'This path monetizes both the article click and the product sale.'
      ];
    } else if (hallway || b >= 120) {
      title = 'Best fit: pet-monitoring article + guide';
      blurb = 'They probably want a reliable setup without overbuying. The article builds trust, then the guide closes the sale once they see the full system.';
      primary = guideUrl;
      primaryRoute = 'guide';
      secondary = comparisonUrl;
      secondaryRoute = 'comparison';
      bullets = [
        'Send them to the article cluster first to answer common questions.',
        'Use the guide CTA as the clear next step.',
        'Keep the camera review visible for anyone ready to buy hardware.'
      ];
    }

    results.innerHTML = `
      <div class="result-kicker">Recommended conversion path</div>
      <div class="result-title">${title}</div>
      <div class="result-text">${blurb}</div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="cta primary" href="${primary}" data-plausible-event="pet_monitoring_finder_primary_cta_click" data-plausible-prop-surface="result-primary" data-plausible-prop-route="${primaryRoute}" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored">Open primary CTA</a>
        <a class="cta secondary" href="${secondary}" data-plausible-event="pet_monitoring_finder_supporting_link_click" data-plausible-prop-surface="result-supporting" data-plausible-prop-route="${secondaryRoute}">Open supporting content</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="list">
        ${bullets.map((item) => `<li>${item}</li>`).join('')}
      </ul>
      <p class="small" style="margin-top:14px;">
        Budget: ${formatBudget(b)} · Privacy: ${state.privacy === 'local' ? 'local-only' : 'cloud okay'} · Use case: ${state.useCase.replace('-', ' ')}
      </p>
    `;

    const inline = document.getElementById('primary-link-inline');
    if (inline) {
      inline.href = primary;
      inline.dataset.plausiblePropRoute = primaryRoute;
    }
  }

  budgetInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
    state.budget = Number(budgetInput.value);
    budgetLabel.textContent = formatBudget(state.budget);
    calcRecommendation();
  });

  useCase.addEventListener('change', () => {
    state.useCase = useCase.value;
    calcRecommendation();
  });

  privacyButtons.forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      state.privacy = btn.dataset.privacy;
      privacyButtons.forEach((other) => other.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(other === btn)));
      calcRecommendation();
    });
  });

  budgetLabel.textContent = formatBudget(state.budget);
  calcRecommendation();
</script>

<style>
  .finder-hero {
    padding: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(26, 107, 60, 0.08), transparent 30%);
  }

  .finder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(320px, 0.85fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(22, 32, 42, 0.08);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1a6b3c;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    max-width: 11ch;
  }

  .subtitle {
    margin: 0;
    color: #5f6c7b;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .metrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
  }

  .metric {
    background: #f0f4f8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.9rem;
  }

  .metric strong { display: block; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
  .metric span { color: #5f6c7b; font-size: 0.92rem; }

  .panel {
    padding: 1.4rem;
  }

  .panel h2,
  .content h3,
  .support h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .panel p,
  .content p,
  .support p {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: #5f6c7b;
  }

  .field { margin: 1rem 0; }
  label { display: block; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }

  select,
  input[type='range'] {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem;
    font: inherit;
    background: white;
  }

  .range-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    color: #5f6c7b;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  .segmented {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .segmented button {
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    background: white;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .segmented button[aria-pressed='true'] {
    border-color: #1a6b3c;
    background: rgba(26, 107, 60, 0.09);
    color: #0f4f2c;
  }

  .results {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(26, 107, 60, 0.08), rgba(26, 107, 60, 0.02));
    border: 1px solid rgba(26, 107, 60, 0.15);
    border-radius: 1rem;
  }

  .result-kicker {
    color: #1a6b3c;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .result-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .result-text { color: #16202a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.65rem; }

  .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 800;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .cta.primary { background: #1a6b3c; color: white; }
  .cta.secondary { background: white; color: #16202a; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); }

  .list { margin: 0.75rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; }
  .list li { margin: 0.45rem 0; }

  .grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .content { padding: 1.5rem; }
  .pill-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.45rem; margin-top: 0.8rem; }
  .pill {
    background: #f0f4f8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .support { margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1.5rem; }
  .footer-note { margin-top: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .small { font-size: 0.92rem; }

  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .finder-grid,
    .grid-2,
    .metrics,
    .segmented {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebPage',
  name: 'Home Assistant Pet Monitoring Setup Finder',
  description: 'Revenue-focused setup finder that routes pet-monitoring traffic to the right Home Assistant guide and camera resources.',
  about: ['Home Assistant', 'pet monitoring', 'home automation'],
  isPartOf: {
    '@type': 'WebSite',
    name: 'filce.uk',
    url: 'https://filce.uk/'
  },
  primaryImageOfPage: 'https://filce.uk/images/ha-guide-cover.jpg',
  potentialAction: {
    '@type': 'ViewAction',
    target: [
      'https://gumroad.com/l/ai-home-assistant-guide?utm_source=filce_uk&utm_medium=quiz&utm_campaign=pet_monitoring_guide',
      '/posts/home-assistant-pet-monitoring/',
      '/posts/reolink-fisheye-camera-review/'
    ]
  }
})} />
